{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":20,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cLp_eq_cLm_of_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cLp_eq_cLm_of_eq","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L69-L73","doc":"When the two photons are identical (`φ = ψ`) the Hopf link is\nbalanced: the `L₊` and `L₋` coefficients agree. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cLp_mul_cLm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cLp_mul_cLm","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L64-L67","doc":"The Hopf-link coefficients arise purely from the cross-color products;\ntheir product is the fully symmetric `φ₀φ₁ψ₀ψ₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cσ₀_classical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cσ₀_classical","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L59-L62","doc":"**Classical limit** `h = 0`: the `σ₀` coefficient loses its\n`q`-correction and reduces to the free-product value `φ₀ + ψ₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cLm_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cLm_def","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L51-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cLp_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cLp_def","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L50-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cσ₁_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cσ₁_def","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L49-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cσ₀_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cσ₀_def","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cγ_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cγ_def","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L47-L47","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cLm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cLm","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Coefficient of the negative Hopf link `L₋ = σ₁σ₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cLp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cLp","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Coefficient of the positive Hopf link `L₊ = σ₀σ₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cσ₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cσ₁","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L42-L42","doc":"Coefficient of `σ₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cσ₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cσ₀","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Coefficient of `σ₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cγ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.cγ","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Coefficient of `γ` (the identity knot). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.h","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.h","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L36-L36","doc":"Deformation `h = q − q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.ψ₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.ψ₁","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L34-L34","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.ψ₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.ψ₀","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Color weights of `γ₂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.φ₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.φ₁","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L31-L31","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.φ₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.φ₀","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L30-L30","doc":"Color weights of `γ₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction.mk","kind":"ctor","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QuarkAntiquarkProduction","kind":"structure","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QuarkAntiquarkProduction.lean#L23-L51","doc":"Coefficient data for `NF(γ₁·γ₂)`.\n\nA `definition` carrier: the two photons' color weights `φ₀,φ₁` and\n`ψ₀,ψ₁`, the deformation `h`, and the five normal-form coefficients each\npinned to its manuscript value. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:quark-antiquark-production","label":"def:quark-antiquark-production","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/quark-antiquark-production.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}